#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1485
msgid ""
"Display limited to %d rows on this device; the larger Limit still buffers "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"Anzeige auf diesem Gerät auf %d Zeilen begrenzt; das größere Limit puffert "
"weiterhin Zeilen."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2475
msgid "Display options"
msgstr "Anzeigeoptionen"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2568
msgid ""
"Display options set Limit, Fetch budget, Maximum raw lines, row tint, "
"palette, and hostnames."
msgstr ""
"Anzeigeoptionen setzen Limit, Abrufbudget, maximale Rohzeilen, "
"Zeileneinfärbung, Palette und Hostnamen."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:234
msgid "Does not change:"
msgstr "Ändert nicht:"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:251
msgid "Don’t show this again"
msgstr "Nicht mehr anzeigen"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:90
msgid "Enable WAN zone drop/reject logging (same as Network → Firewall)."
msgstr ""
"Drop/Reject-Protokollierung der WAN-Zone aktivieren (wie unter Netzwerk → "
"Firewall)."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:96
msgid "Enable logging"
msgstr "Protokollierung aktivieren"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2563
msgid ""
"Enable logging turns on WAN zone drop/reject logging only (same as Network → "
"Firewall). It does not add rules or log normal LAN browsing."
msgstr ""
"„Protokollierung aktivieren“ schaltet nur die Drop/Reject-Protokollierung "
"der WAN-Zone ein (wie unter Netzwerk → Firewall). Es fügt keine Regeln hinzu "
"und protokolliert keinen normalen LAN-Verkehr."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:96
msgid "Enabling…"
msgstr "Wird aktiviert…"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1945
msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "Ausschließen"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:91
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:190
msgid "Exclude instead"
msgstr "Stattdessen ausschließen"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2489
msgid "Fetch budget"
msgstr "Abrufbudget"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2578
msgid ""
"Fetch budget controls raw log lines per poll. Auto derives from Limit; "
"Manual selects a bounded maximum."
msgstr ""
"Das Abrufbudget steuert die Rohzeilen pro Abfrage. Auto leitet es aus dem "
"Limit ab; Manuell wählt ein begrenztes Maximum."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:63
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:84
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:149
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2826
msgid "Filter by %s"
msgstr "Filtern nach %s"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:122
msgid "Filter logs by rule (hint: %s). Ctrl+click to open firewall settings."
msgstr ""
"Logs nach Regel filtern (Hinweis: %s). Strg+Klick öffnet die Firewall-"
"Einstellungen."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2652
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-fwlive.json:3
msgid "Firewall Live View"
msgstr "Firewall-Live-Ansicht"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1709
msgid "Firewall log has no current entries; showing rows last received %s ago."
msgstr ""
"Im Firewall-Protokoll sind derzeit keine Einträge; angezeigt werden Zeilen, "
"die zuletzt vor %s empfangen wurden."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:49
msgid "Flags"
msgstr "Flags"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:51
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "Fluss"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2588
msgid ""
"For a responsive table on a weak device, keep Limit at 250 rows or below. "
"The weak-device cap affects rendered rows; the buffer can still retain more."
msgstr ""
"Für eine responsive Tabelle auf einem schwachen Gerät sollte Limit auf "
"höchstens 250 Zeilen stehen. Die Schwachgerätebegrenzung betrifft die "
"angezeigten Zeilen; der Puffer kann weiterhin mehr Zeilen behalten."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:64
msgid "Forwarded"
msgstr "Weitergeleitet"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fwlive.json:3
msgid "Grant access to firewall live log view"
msgstr "Zugriff auf die Live-Ansicht der Firewall-Protokolle gewähren"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2554
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Hilfe"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:151
msgid "Hide full message"
msgstr "Vollständige Nachricht ausblenden"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1583
msgid "Hide rows"
msgstr "Zeilen ausblenden"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1481
msgid "Hostname lookup paused while the router is under load."
msgstr "Hostnamenauflösung pausiert, solange der Router ausgelastet ist."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1936
msgid "ICMPv6"
msgstr "ICMPv6"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:41
msgid "IN"
msgstr "EINGANG"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2625
msgid ""
"If Row tint looks missing, the active LuCI theme may omit success/error or "
"info/warn CSS variables; fwlive falls back to local colors (air-gapped, no "
"data leaves the device)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn die Zeileneinfärbung fehlt, verwendet das aktive LuCI-Theme "
"möglicherweise keine Erfolgs/Fehler-CSS-Variablen; fwlive fällt auf lokale "
"Farben zurück (air-gapped, keine Daten verlassen das Gerät)."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:353
msgid ""
"If the WAN is quiet, wait for probes or use the optional ping check in "
"Help / the enabling-logs guide."
msgstr ""
"Wenn das WAN ruhig ist, warten Sie auf Probes oder nutzen Sie den optionalen "
"Ping-Test in der Hilfe / der Anleitung zum Aktivieren der Protokollierung."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2609
msgid ""
"In Simple view, activate the message button or click a row to show or hide "
"the full message."
msgstr ""
"In der einfachen Ansicht können Sie die Nachrichtenschaltfläche aktivieren "
"oder auf eine Zeile klicken, um die vollständige Meldung ein- oder "
"auszublenden."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:62
msgid "Inbound"
msgstr "Eingehend"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:92
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:190
