msgstr "Stattdessen einschließen"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:318
msgid ""
"Install kmod-nf-log and kmod-nf-log6 with the command for your OpenWrt "
"release, then reload the firewall."
msgstr ""
"Installieren Sie kmod-nf-log und kmod-nf-log6 mit dem Befehl für Ihre "
"OpenWrt-Version und laden Sie dann die Firewall neu."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1740
msgid "Installation is incomplete. Reinstall luci-app-fwlive."
msgstr "Installation unvollständig. Installieren Sie luci-app-fwlive neu."

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/log.js:441
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:40
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Schnittstelle"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2872
